                  <photoshop:LayerName>By Eliezer Yudkowsky Based on the works of J. K. Rowling</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>By Eliezer Yudkowsky Based on the works of J. K. Rowling</photoshop:LayerText>
